            "text": "{\"model\":\"anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5\",\"messages\":[{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The conversation history before this point was compacted into the following summary:\\n\\n<summary>\\n## Goal\\nThe user is checking weather via the `get_weather` tool and wants short, comparative answers. The current task is to compare Tokyo and Paris weather in one sentence.\\n\\n## Constraints & Preferences\\n- Use the `get_weather` tool to get data.\\n- Answers should be one short sentence.\\n- For the second request, call `get_weather` for Tokyo and Paris in parallel, in one step, then compare in one sentence.\\n\\n## Progress\\n### Done\\n- [x] Called `get_weather(city=\\\"Tokyo\\\")` and answered: \\\"Tokyo is clear and 25°C, with wind at 10 km/h.\\\"\\n- [x] Called `get_weather` for Tokyo and Paris in parallel in one step. Tokyo succeeded; Paris failed.\\n- [x] Replied that no comparison was possible because the Paris data was unavailable.\\n\\n### In Progress\\n- [ ] (none)\\n\\n### Blocked\\n- Paris weather unavailable: the tool returned \\\"Weather service unavailable for Paris\\\".\\n\\n## Key Decisions\\n- **Reported the Paris failure instead of guessing**: The comparison could not be made without Paris data, so the assistant gave Tokyo's weather and explained the gap.\\n\\n## Next Steps\\n1. If the user wants, retry `get_weather(city=\\\"Paris\\\")` and then compare it with Tokyo in one sentence.\\n2. Otherwise wait for the user's next instruction.\\n\\n## Critical Context\\n- Tokyo weather: clear, 25°C, wind 10 km/h.\\n- Paris weather: not obtained (error: \\\"Weather service unavailable for Paris\\\").\\n\\n---\\n\\n**Turn Context (split turn):**\\n\\n## Original Request\\nThe user asked what time it is in Tokyo. They told the assistant to use the get_time tool and then answer briefly.\\n\\n## Progress So Far\\n- The assistant called get_time(city=\\\"Tokyo\\\").\\n- The tool returned \\\"Tokyo: 09:00\\\".\\n- No final answer to the user is shown in these messages.\\n\\n## Context Needed to Continue\\n- The current time in Tokyo, per the get_time result, is 09:00.\\n- The user wants a brief answer, so the remaining step is to give them the time.\\n</summary>\"}]},{\"role\":\"system\",\"content\":[],\"output_config\":{\"effort\":\"medium\"}},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"It's 09:00 in Tokyo.\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Is that warm? One word.\"}]},{\"role\":\"system\",\"content\":[],\"output_config\":{\"effort\":\"medium\"}},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Yes. (Tokyo is 25°C.)\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Should I bring an umbrella? One word.\"}]},{\"role\":\"system\",\"content\":[],\"output_config\":{\"effort\":\"medium\"}},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"No. (Tokyo is clear.)\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Thanks. One word.\",\"cache_control\":{\"type\":\"ephemeral\"}}]},{\"role\":\"system\",\"content\":[],\"output_config\":{\"effort\":\"medium\"}}],\"max_tokens\":128000,\"stream\":true,\"system\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"You are a weather assistant. Answer briefly.\\n\\n<addendum>\\nReference for pi-restore-openrouter-claude-sonnet-5-5-combined: the weather desk's station catalog. Use it only when asked.\\n- Station 1: code WX001, elevation 0 m, reports hourly.\\n- Station 2: code WX002, elevation 37 m, reports hourly.\\n- Station 3: code WX003, elevation 74 m, reports hourly.\\n- Station 4: code WX004, elevation 111 m, reports hourly.\\n- Station 5: code WX005, elevation 148 m, reports hourly.\\n- Station 6: code WX006, elevation 185 m, reports hourly.\\n- Station 7: code WX007, elevation 222 m, reports hourly.\\n- Station 8: code WX008, elevation 259 m, reports hourly.\\n- Station 9: code WX009, elevation 296 m, reports hourly.\\n- Station 10: cod